 "source_status": "M.Sc. thesis (İTÜ 2008) documenting 9 'tip' beams used in Turkish bridge superstructures; issuing authority not stated",
 "origin_note": "The thesis (Özet p.xi; §3 p.7) describes the beams only as '9 tip öngerilmeli prefabrike I kesitli köprü kirişi' used in bridge superstructures ('köprü üst yapısında kullanılan'). It does NOT attribute the shapes to KGM (Karayolları Genel Müdürlüğü) type drawings or to a producer; KGM is cited only for the H30-S24 live load (KGM Yol Köprüleri için Teknik Şartname, 1973). Any KGM attribution is therefore unverified. The shapes are plain I-sections with splayed flanges (not 'fish-belly' in elevation), placed side by side at 78 cm (TİP I/II) or 99 cm (TİP III) centres with a 25 cm in-situ slab (§2.1).",
